BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:state-pte-district-of-columbia-2025-04-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:District of Columbia: D-65 (partnership) / D-30 (unincorporated bus
 iness) due
DESCRIPTION:DC's partnership return (D-65) and unincorporated business fran
 chise tax return (D-30) are both confirmed due April 15\, 2026 for a calend
 ar-year filer\, directly from the current (2025 tax year) OTR booklets for 
 each form. DC does not recognize federal S-corp status for franchise tax pu
 rposes - S corporations doing business in DC generally file the D-20 corpor
 ate return instead\, not D-65 or D-30. DC's PTE elective tax (proposed in a
  2022 OCFO testimony) was not confirmed as enacted or as having its own sep
 arate deadline this session. | DC's partnership return (D-65) and unincorpo
 rated business franchise tax return (D-30) are both due April 15\, 2026 for
  a calendar-year filer. DC does not recognize federal S-corp status for fra
 nchise tax purposes - S corporations generally file the D-20 corporate retu
 rn instead. File Form FR-165 (D-65) or FR-130 (D-30) by the original due da
 te for an automatic 6-month extension (to October 15\, 2026)\; a federal ex
 tension does not automatically extend the DC due date. | Authority: DC Offi
 ce of Tax and Revenue\, direct fetch this session of the current-year form 
 booklets: D-65 booklet - "Calendar year filer - April 15\, 2026"\, "A 6-mon
 th extension of time to file will be allowed if you complete this form prop
 erly\, and file it on time" (Form FR-165)\; D-30 booklet - "Non-exempt orga
 nizations must file their return and pay any tax due by: Calendar year file
 r - April 15\, 2026." | Source: https://otr.cfo.dc.gov/sites/default/files/
 dc/sites/otr/publication/attachments/2025_D-65_Book_Final_wLinks_02232026.p
 df | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a lat
 er-announced change\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it
 .
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
